      "narration_text": "Claude.ai is turn-based. You type. The model produces text. You read. You decide what to do. The loop is you. Claude Code is an agentic loop. The model gathers context — reads files, runs read-only commands. It takes action — edits files, runs commands. It verifies results. Then it loops again: gather, act, verify. That entire loop can run for many iterations before reporting back. The loop is Claude. Wrong actions accumulate before you see the explanation.",
